## ---- Enabling Git LFS later (optional, recommended for real art assets) ----
## When the project starts holding large binaries, move them to LFS:
##   1) Install:  macOS -> `brew install git-lfs`   Windows -> https://git-lfs.com
##   2) Run once per machine:  `git lfs install`
##   3) For each binary type above, replace `binary` with:
##          filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
##      e.g.  *.png  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
##   4) Migrate already-committed binaries:  `git lfs migrate import --include="*.png,*.fbx,..."`
